            "heading": "👉 Odkaz",
            "icon": "",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<ol><li>Carlos Carrasco-Gallardo, Leonardo Guzmán, and Ricardo B. Maccioni, \"Shilajit: A Natural Phytocomplex with Potential Procognitive Activity\" <em>National Library of Medicine</em>, <a href=\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC3296184/\">Link</a></li><li>Medically reviewed by Debra Rose Wilson, Ph.D., MSN, R.N., IBCLC, AHN-BC, CHT – By Jon Johnson, \"Ten benefits of shilajit\" <em>MedicalNewsToday</em>, <a href=\"https://www.medicalnewstoday.com/articles/322043\">Link</a></li><li>Parisa Kangari, Leila Roshangar, Aida Iraji, Tahereh Talaei-Khozani, and Mahboobeh Razmkhah, \"Accelerating effect of Shilajit on osteogenic property of adipose-derived mesenchymal stem cells (ASCs)\" <em>Journal of Alternative and Complementary Medicine, U.S. National Library of Medicine</em>, <a href=\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC9509599/\">Link</a></li><li>Amitava Das, Mohamed S. El Masry, Surya C. Gnyawali, Subhadip Ghatak, Kanhaiya Singh, Richard Stewart, Madeline Lewis, Abhijoy Saha, Gayle Gordillo, and Savita Khannab, \"Skin Transcriptome of Middle-Aged Women Supplemented With Natural Herbo-mineral Shilajit Shows Induction of Microvascular and Extracellular Matrix Mechanisms\" <em>National Library of Medicine</em>, <a href=\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC7027386/\">Link</a></li><li>Joshua L. Keller, Terry J. Housh, Ethan C. Hill, Cory M. Smith, Richard J. Schmidt, and Glen O. Johnson, \"The effects of Shilajit supplementation on fatigue-induced decreases in muscular strength and serum hydroxyproline levels\" <em>National Library of Medicine</em>, <a href=\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC6364418/\">Link</a><br/></li><li>T. Kloskowski, K. Szeliski, K. Krzeszowiak, Z. Fekner, T. Kazimierski, A. Jundzitt, T. Drewa, and M. Pokrywezynska, \"Mumio (Shilajit) as a potential chemotherapeutic for the urinary bladder cancer treatment\" <em>National Library of Medicine</em>, <a href=\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC8604984/\">Link</a><br/></li><li>Rong Ding, Mingming Zhao, Jiuyu Fan, Xiuquan Hu, Meng Wang, Shihong Zhong, and Rui Gu, \"Mechanisms of generation and exudation of Tibetan medicine Shilajit (zhaxun)\" <em>National Library of Medicine</em>, <a href=\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC7322889/\">Link</a><br/></li><li>Ebtihaj J. Jambia and Fawzia Abdulaziz Alshubailya, \"Shilajit potentiates the effect of chemotherapeutic drugs and mitigates metastasis induced liver and kidney damages in osteosarcoma rats\" <em>National Library of Medicine</em>, <a href=\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC9358466/\">Link</a><br/></li><li>Fawzia A. Alshubaily and Ebtihaj J. Jambi, \"Correlation between Antioxidant and Anti-Osteoporotic Activities of Shilajit Loaded into Chitosan Nanoparticles and Their Effects on Osteoporosis in Rats\" <em>National Library of Medicine</em>, <a href=\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC9571855/\">Link</a><br/></li><li>Victor Andrade, Maylin Wong-Guerra, Nicole Cortés, Gabriela Pastor, Andrea González, Camila Calfío, Leonardo Guzmán-Martinez, Leonardo P. Navarrete, Nicolas Ramos-Escobar, Inelia Morales, Rocío Santander, Juan Andrades-Lagos, Mitchell Bacho, Leonel E. Rojo, and Ricardo Benjamin Maccioni, \"Scaling the Andean Shilajit: A Novel Neuroprotective Agent for Alzheimer's Disease\" <em>National Library of Medicine</em>, <a href=\"https://www.ncbi.nim.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC10383824/\">Link</a><br/></li><li>Igor A. Schepetkin, Gang Xie, Mark A. Jutila, and Mark T. Quinn, \"Complement-fixing Activity of Fulvic Acid from Shilajit and Other Natural Sources\" <em>National Library of Medicine</em>, <a href=\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC2650748/\">Link</a><br/></li><li>Priya Bansal and Sugato Banerjee, \"Effect of Withinia Somnifera and Shilajit on Alcohol Addiction in Mice\" <em>National Library of Medicine</em>, <a href=\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC4883068/\">Link